script = ExtResource("1_lsmo2")
release_version = "v1.3.7 (CM37E)"
notes = "[TITLE] Facilties
Various unused rooms were added to the game! (Albeit adjusted and some are original) The following was added:
  4 New Rooms added to the Factory (Two original)
  3 New Rooms added to the Mint (All original)
  5 New Rooms added to the D.A. Office (Two original)
  3 New Rooms added to the Cog Golf Course (Two original)
  4 New Rooms added to the Molten Mint (One original)
Every facility now has special MEGA Cog battles! These rooms have 7 cogs in one fight! Beating this tough battle will let you access some special chests.
The Goontorial Room can now appear multiple times
The Mole Game Sand Trap room is now a special room with special chests due to how hard it is compared to normal Mole Stomp.
Fixed the Boiler Room's textures
Cog bosses will now be even harder starting Floor 8
[TITLE] Cog Creator
You can now give non-proxies proxy abilities. Just remember to adjust the slider if need be!
[TITLE] Misc.
Heckle's effects now increase every 5 floors.
Hazard Damage now scales every 5 floors.
Partner Toon damage will now scale with your damage.
The Clowns, Slendercog, and his Vessels are now Administrators (Their HP will now scale in endless)
Fixed the randomize effects of stat boost being able to affect accuracy.
[TITLE] Hotfix 1
Made several sliders in the Cog Creator be able to go beyond their limits.
  A couple sliders were adjusted, too.
Somewhat fixed quirk with Custom Cogs being able to have a maximum level below their minimum, letting them spawn with lower than usual levels.
  Do note that you'll have to manually change your max level if your cog's minimum level is above 20 for whatever reason.
Napoleon Hat will now properly work with cog scales below 2.5 and above 8.0, with a newly adjusted formula."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://d1j0hh6tsgy0r"
